  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-ab3b1110-7fff-866e-6770-b790efc39904&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;​The proposal, by virtue of its detailed design and architectural significance, would result in a harmful replacement that fails to preserve the character and appearance of the site, wider terrace and the Brownswood Conservation Area. The proposal is therefore considered contrary to Policy D3 (Optimising Design), Policy HC1 (Heritage Conservation and Growth) Hackney Local Plan 2033: Policy LP1 (Design Quality) and Policy LP3 (Heritage, Conservation Areas and the Brownswood Conservation Area Appraisal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
